# Disable ALL end-of-line conversion for this repo.
#
# Why: this repo stores fixed-width vendor extracts (Voya, Newport, ADP,
# Paychex, OneAmerica, Vanguard, BASEREMIT 773/553-char lines, ...) where
# field positions are byte offsets. Any automatic CRLF<->LF rewrite by git
# would shift column alignment in the fixtures and silently change what the
# parser reads. Bytes must round-trip exactly.
#
# This also stops git from reporting whole-file "modifications" that are
# nothing but line-ending flips, which makes real diffs reviewable.
* -text
